# "Blocks" triggers once per blocker, not once per attacker it blocks (CR 509.3a, 702.22h).
# A 0/4 Spellskite blocks a two-creature band, producing exactly one Pursuer trigger and no player combat damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Tetsuko Umezawa, Pursuer
Benalish Hero
Guerrilla Gorilla
Mountain x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Spellskite
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
